    "features": "<p><strong>AKA:</strong> Bro, Drunk, Yobbo</p><p>Holding several pints of lager in the tank, and raring for a brawl with anyone who should so much as look at them the wrong way, the hooligan is a destructive force of nature. Unlikely to enter the membership of a criminal gang or anything so formal, a hooligan’s drunkenness and desire to spar plays out more often in pubs, dark streets, and the stands of a sports match. The hooligan is having a good time, and anyone who disagrees needs their mind changed with his fists.</p><p><strong>Favored Stunts:</strong> Adrenaline Rush, Whatever’s Handy</p><p><strong>Talents:</strong> Hurled Weapon Style (Novice), Party Animal (Novice)</p><p><strong>Equipment:</strong> Baseball Bat, Bike Chain, Football Scarf, Heavy Leather Jacket, Knuckle Dusters</p>",
